  <% provide(:title, 'Rhombus - About us') %>
  <div class="hero-content pricing w-container">
    <h1 class="hero-h1 home-header pricing-hero">About Relay</h1>
    <h5 class="hero-section-sub signup-box-subheading">CONVERSATIONAL COMMERCE PLATFORM</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="about-relay def-content-row w-row">
    <div class="pricing-row-column-1 w-clearfix w-col w-col-7">
      <div class="def-row-content-wrapper picture-bg"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-row-column-2 w-clearfix w-col w-col-5">
        <div class="def-row-content-wrapper">
          <h1 class="about-relay-mission alt first-content-section-sub-header">Mission: Make customer communication personal again.</h1>
          <p class="about-relay-paragraph alt def-content-section-paragraph">Think back to the most pleasant face-to-face interactions you've had with customers--you recognize them once they walk in, and every interaction is personalized. That's how customer communication should be across every channel.
            <br>
            <br>We are building the best messaging software for managing sales, marketing and customer service interactions online, and on mobile.
            <br>
            <br>Relay makes it easy to talk to your customers inside the popular messaging apps they use everyday. Our goal is to help your business build real connections by reaching customers on their own terms.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
